out.push("\n\n这个实验引出了一个非常重要的区别：\n\n**Focus（焦点）和 Selection（选中）不是同一个概念。**\n\n| 概念 | 含义 |\n|---|---|\n| Focus | 用户当前正在操作哪个元素 |\n| Selection | 组件当前实际选中了哪个元素 |\n| `tabindex=\"0\"` | 哪个元素是组件的顺序焦点入口 |\n| `aria-selected=\"true\"` | 哪个选项处于选中状态 |\n\n在手动激活的 Tabs 中，焦点可以位于 Specifications，而当前展示的内容仍然是 Description。\n\n因此，不应该直接用 `aria-selected` 来表示键盘焦点。\n\n### 9.3 完整 Tabs HTML\n\n```html\n<div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Product information\">\n\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    role=\"tab\"\n    id=\"tab-description\"\n    aria-selected=\"true\"\n    aria-controls=\"panel-description\"\n    tabindex=\"0\"\n  >\n    Description\n  </button>\n\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    role=\"tab\"\n    id=\"tab-specifications\"\n    aria-selected=\"false\"\n    aria-controls=\"panel-specifications\"\n    tabindex=\"-1\"\n  >\n    Specifications\n  </button>\n\n  <button\n    type=\"button\"\n    role=\"tab\"\n    id=\"tab-reviews\"\n    aria-selected=\"false\"\n    aria-controls=\"panel-reviews\"\n    tabindex=\"-1\"\n  >\n    Reviews\n  </button>\n\n</div>\n\n<div\n  role=\"tabpanel\"\n  id=\"panel-description\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"tab-description\"\n  tabindex=\"0\"\n>\n  Made from 100% premium cotton.\n</div>\n\n<div\n  role=\"tabpanel\"\n  id=\"panel-specifications\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"tab-specifications\"\n  tabindex=\"0\"\n  hidden\n>\n  Material: Cotton. Weight: 220 g.\n</div>\n\n<div\n  role=\"tabpanel\"\n  id=\"panel-reviews\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"tab-reviews\"\n  tabindex=\"0\"\n  hidden\n>\n  Rated 4.8 out of 5.\n</div>\n```\n\n这里的 tabpanel 包含普通文字，因此设置 tabindex=\"0\"，让键盘用户能够从 Tab 列表进入当前面板。如果面板起始处已经有合适的可聚焦控件，就不一定需要给面板本身添加 tabindex。\n\n### 9.4 JavaScript 实现\n\n下面采用手动激活模式。\n\n```javascript\nconst tablist = document.querySelector('[role=\"tablist\"]');\n\nconst tabs = [\n  ...tablist.querySelectorAll('[role=\"tab\"]')\n];\n\nfunction moveFocus(index) {\n  tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {\n    tab.tabIndex = i === index ? 0 : -1;\n  });\n\n  tabs[index].focus();\n}\n\nfunction activateTab(index) {\n  tabs.forEach((tab, i) => {\n    const selected = index === i;\n\n    tab.setAttribute(\n      'aria-selected',\n      String(selected)\n    );\n\n    const panel = document.getElementById(\n      tab.getAttribute('aria-controls')\n    );\n\n    panel.hidden = !selected;\n  });\n}\n\ntabs.forEach((tab, index) => {\n  tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    moveFocus(index);\n    activateTab(index);\n  });\n});\n\ntablist.addEventListener('keydown', event => {\n  const index = tabs.indexOf(document.activeElement);\n\n  if (index === -1) return;\n\n  let nextIndex;\n\n  switch (event.key) {\n    case 'ArrowRight':\n      nextIndex = (index + 1) % tabs.length;\n      break;\n\n    case 'ArrowLeft':\n      nextIndex =\n        (index - 1 + tabs.length) % tabs.length;\n      break;\n\n    case 'Home':\n      nextIndex = 0;\n      break;\n\n    case 'End':\n      nextIndex = tabs.length - 1;\n      break;\n\n    default:\n      return;\n  }\n\n  event.preventDefault();\n\n  moveFocus(nextIndex);\n});\n```\n\n因为这里使用原生 button，所以不需要单独处理 Enter 和 Space，它们已经会触发 click 事件。\n\n对于手动激活模式，还可以在焦点离开整个 tablist 后，将下一次 Tab 入口恢复到当前选中的 Tab：\n\n```javascript\ntablist.addEventListener('focusout', event => {\n  if (tablist.contains(event.relatedTarget)) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  tabs.forEach(tab => {\n    tab.tabIndex =\n      tab.getAttribute('aria-selected') === 'true'\n        ? 0\n        : -1;\n  });\n});\n```\n\n如果希望实现自动激活，则可以在方向键移动焦点后追加：\n\n```javascript\nmoveFocus(nextIndex);\nactivateTab(nextIndex);\n```\n\n通常只有在内容切换足够及时、不会产生明显等待时，才推荐使用自动激活模式。如果每次切换都需要 AJAX 请求，手动激活可能更加合适。");
